# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# GitHub Pages used to issue the www -> apex redirect for free. Cloudflare Pages
# SERVES a custom domain rather than redirecting it, so without this rule the
# whole site would answer on both hostnames — duplicate content against the
# canonical URLs that sitemap.ts, the OG tags and lib/og-card.tsx all emit at
# the apex. Splat preserves the path.
https://www.mncoleman.com/* https://mncoleman.com/:splat 301
